1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:05,710
(Amy:)Penny's friend Zack stopped by
and said hello and I said "hoo."

2
00:00:05,710 --> 00:00:06,910
(Raj:)Who?

3
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:08,220
(Penny:)Zack.

4
00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:10,450
(Sheldon:)Then why did you ask?

5
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:12,590
(Amy:)Ask what?
Who.

6
00:00:12,590 --> 00:00:14,390
(Penny:)Zack.

7
00:00:14,390 --> 00:00:17,490
(Sheldon:)All right, let's start over.

8
00:00:17,490 --> 00:00:19,590
(Sheldon:)What did you say
when Zack walked in?

9
00:00:19,590 --> 00:00:22,230
"Hoo."
Zack.

10
00:00:22,230 --> 00:00:24,000
Why do you keep saying "Zack"?

11
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,670
Because you keep saying "who."

12
00:00:25,670 --> 00:00:27,200
I'm not saying "hoo" now.

13
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:28,340
I said "hoo" last night.

14
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:30,670
(Sheldon:)And the answer was Zack,
correct?

15
00:00:30,670 --> 00:00:32,470
(Amy:)There was no question.

16
00:00:32,470 --> 00:00:34,280
I simply said "hoo."

17
00:00:36,450 --> 00:00:38,580
(Sheldon:)All right, I think
I have enough to go on.

18
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:42,650
(Sheldon:)Possible explanations
for your symptoms are,

19
00:00:42,650 --> 00:00:44,950
(Sheldon:)in descending order
of likelihood:

20
00:00:44,950 --> 00:00:47,590
(Sheldon:)hyperthyroidism,
premature menopause,

21
00:00:47,590 --> 00:00:50,890
(Sheldon:)hosting an alien parasite or--

22
00:00:50,890 --> 00:00:53,230
(Sheldon:)and I only include it
for the sake of covering

23
00:00:53,230 --> 00:00:59,020
(Sheldon:)absolutely all bases--
sexual arousal.

